sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CF as Cloudflare Access
    participant Web as cctv-web
    participant API as cctv-api
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant LK as LiveKit Cloud

    User->>CF: Open dashboard
    CF->>CF: Authenticate with IdP
    CF->>Web: Forward request with Access JWT
    Web->>API: Same-origin API request
    API->>API: Verify CF Access JWT
    API->>DB: Load user, role, camera ACL
    API->>LK: Mint viewer-only token
    API-->>Web: Return authorized camera metadata and token
    Web-->>User: Render dashboard and subscribe to media
